===Begining===
We grew up in the slums, surrounded by the tormented souls of both the dead and the living. #speaker: Marcus #portrait:marcus #layout:left
Our father was never there #speaker: Marcus #portrait:marcus #layout:left
Our mother tried her best, raising a set of twins on her own couldn't have been easy. #speaker: Marcus #portrait:marcus #layout:left
She worked herself to death soon after our 8th birthday #speaker: Marcus #portrait:marcus #layout:left
After that you were my rock, although I was technically older, You raised me. You got us off the streets. Got me this job. I owe everything to you. But I dont remember if I had ever said thank you. #speaker: Marcus #portrait:marcus #layout:left
But I guess its too late for that now... #speaker: Marcus #portrait:marcus #layout:left
->END